{"articleNo":"557870","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=557870&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 「2026년 기술창업교육」 예비 및 초기 창업자 모집","writer":"강소특구육성사업단","writeDate":"2026.04.03","hit":"4862","attachments":[{"name":"[붙임1]경북구미강소특구『2026년 기술창업교육』 예비 및 초기창업자 모집 공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=557870&attachNo=162701"},{"name":"[붙임2]2026년 기술창업교육 예비(초기)창업자 참가신청서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=557870&attachNo=162702"},{"name":"[붙임3]2026년 기술창업교육 예비(초기)창업자 개인정보 수집 및 활용 동의서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=557870&attachNo=162703"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국립금오공과대학교 경북구미강소연구개발특구는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 기술창업교육 사업</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">」</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 통해 창업아이템&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">검증 및 다양한 창업 프로그램을 제공하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지역의 유망한 예비 및 초기창업자의 성공적인 사업화를 통해 지역 내 기술창업 생태계를 활성화하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예비 및 초기창업자 여러분의 많은 관심과 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모집규모</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">:</span> 25</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">팀 내외 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개인 또는 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지원대상</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">:</span> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예비창업자 및 3년 이내 초기창업자</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">접수기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2026. 4. 8.(<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">수</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">∼ 5</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. 6.(<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">수</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) 15:00 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">까지</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출서류</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">:</span> [</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">참가신청서 및 사업계획서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, [</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임3</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정보 제공</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이용 동의서</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출방법</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">:</span> </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">경북구미강소특구 홈페이지 - 사업신청 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(링크 :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://iacf.kumoh.ac.kr/innotown/project-list.do\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">https://iacf.kumoh.ac.kr/innotown/project-list.do</a>)</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지원내용</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">:</span> </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모집 공고</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">[붙임1]</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;참조</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">강소특구육성사업단 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(T. 054-478-6792)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoQFkgRAygMwOYGcCSAjACgBwCEAbVALwBNVV8BHADXgDoArfVIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p></pre>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
